codex
The root cause is now concrete: the command sandbox creates a PID namespace without a matching `/proc` view, while Lean 4.22 resolves its installation through `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`. I’m applying a narrow local preload shim under `/tmp/audit-work` that only repairs those self-executable lookups for Lean/Lake; the failed attempt remains in evidence, and the trusted preflight code itself is unchanged.
apply patch
