+| 9 | 34–35 | `f55a8da87fb92ce9e96ebbc4ea82ce71e9cee705e034c1c7003d546479f625c2` | `finalLoopChar`, recurrence | `DEFINITION` |
+
+The canonical JSON hash of that ordered rule list is
